Images

This repository holds no first-party images today. The design system
packages it installs carry their own art and licence notes (sk-sites
ART.md). SRD sprites that the classic app bundles come from sk-content
under that repository's licences.

Some images were generated with PixelLab. PixelLab's terms restrict using its outputs to train other models; that restriction may apply to you.

